<div>
		<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
				<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-800 border border-indigo-200">Embeddings</span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4">Text Embeddings</h1>
		<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">Convert one or more text inputs to vectors using an enabled embedding model. For a batch input, the response contains one vector per input.</p>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Endpoint</h2>
		<div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3.5 mb-8 font-mono text-sm">
				<span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-extrabold text-white bg-emerald-600">POST</span>
				<span class="text-slate-200">https://aiservice.prabisha.com/embeddings</span>
		</div>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Request</h2>
		<pre><code class="language-bash">curl -X POST https://aiservice.prabisha.com/embeddings \
	-H "X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY" \
	-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
	-d '{
		"input": ["First text to embed", "Another text to embed"],
		"model": "gemini-embedding-2-preview",
		"preferredProvider": "GEMINI"
	}'</code></pre>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">Fields</h2>
		<div class="overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 rounded-xl mb-8">
				<table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-slate-200 text-sm">
						<thead class="bg-slate-50"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left">Field</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left">Type</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left">Details</th></tr></thead>
						<tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600">
								<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900">input</td><td class="px-4 py-3">string or string[]</td><td class="px-4 py-3">One text value or a batch of text values. Required.</td></tr>
								<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900">model</td><td class="px-4 py-3">string</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Enabled embedding model ID. If omitted, the router selects an active default.</td></tr>
								<tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-semibold text-slate-900">preferredProvider</td><td class="px-4 py-3">string</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Optional provider name, such as <code>OPENAI</code> or <code>GEMINI</code>.</td></tr>
						</tbody>
				</table>
		</div>

		<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Response</h2>
		<pre><code class="language-json">{
	"embeddings": [
		[0.012, -0.034, 0.056],
		[0.021, 0.018, -0.043]
	],
	"provider": "GEMINI",
	"model": "gemini-embedding-2-preview",
	"usage": {
		"promptTokens": 0,
		"totalTokens": 0
	},
	"providerId": "provider-id",
	"providerModelId": "provider-model-id",
	"latency": 240
}</code></pre>
		<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3">Vector dimensions and token accounting depend on the selected provider and model.</p>
</div>
